# MANIFEST for rocq-qed-roots
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source-of-record paths (relative to the NetTopologySuite.Proofs repo root)
# for every .v file vendored into this standalone package.  `assemble.sh`
# copies these into ./theories, preserving the NTS.Proofs namespace so the
# proof files build unmodified.  The .v files are NOT committed here.
#
# The package carries its own closure of the qed chain:
#   QedPoly (qedpoly) -> QedInterval (qedinterval) -> QedRoots (qedroots)
# plus QedRootsExamples (worked instances + negative controls).
# Stdlib only (Reals / QArith / Qreals / Lra / Lia / List).  No Flocq.
# Axioms: the three stdlib classical-reals axioms (sig_not_dec,
# sig_forall_dec, functional_extensionality_dep) -- NOT axiom-free.

theories/QedPoly.v
theories/QedInterval.v
theories/QedRoots.v
theories/QedRootsExamples.v
